{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "1f3629803b79f1d00bff86e57ea4d3cef9e1b17634ee7146890f965aeab96de9", "ja": "拝啓、おとぎの国より", "zh": "敬启，来自童话王国", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "afd5002012a2fe473ef260edecaa9340bedf1cbbdd23fd04e345914e3b005097", "ja": "志保が琴葉とデートしたと聞き、ずるいと言\nい出すまつり。自分も役作りのためと、志保\nを遊園地に誘う。王子役として見事なエスコ\nートをしてみせた後、志保が悩む歌織の宿題\nについてのヒントも口にするのだった。", "zh": "听说志保和琴叶去约会，茉莉直呼太狡猾\n了。她称自己也是为了揣摩角色，邀请志保\n去了游乐园。在漂亮地展现了王子的护花风\n度后，她还对让志保深感烦恼的歌织的作业\n给出了提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ac44315e19bba7594250a63450d67dfbea77e27a569bc7280a5495357abaf968", "ja": "（ミュージカルのレッスンは毎日続いている。\n歌も、いい感じに仕上がってきた……）", "zh": "（音乐剧的排练每天都在继续。歌唱部分也渐渐进入状态了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4153ff8db639aaa56a9dec857fe56db35bdb1dd2d3e336cc6b660e65f343e8c3", "ja": "（そういえば、昨日のレッスンの後、\n志保は琴葉と出かけたんだったな……）", "zh": "这么说来，昨天练习结束后，志保和琴叶一起出门了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "597560fd3aaabbd478a69d555bf21cc3474ce3f6a713042740d1256ea088c9d4", "ja": "志保ちゃん。\n琴葉ちゃんとデートしたって、本当なのです？", "zh": "志保。\n听说你和琴叶去约会了，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "9eab76126f92534614703eea5eb4cf25700ab23181c53e50a70a689ed88a057a", "ja": "ぶっ！　……けほっ、けほっ。\nな、なんですか、それ。デートって……。", "zh": "噗！……咳咳，咳咳。\n什、什么啊，那种事。约会什么的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "68e7752dd92b78c51158f1879d408feb4fd178718d4dfb999a8e5683365743c9", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんが言ってたのです。ふたりでボートに乗って\nふわふわ・すいーとタイムを満喫したって。", "zh": "琴叶说过哦。说是两个人一起坐船，尽情享受了软绵绵·甜蜜时光。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "a833c9ff3b902f1a9c54eb09427e5ff4218145cbcc1ee67c56d96c1331e31310", "ja": "ふ、ふわふわ・すいーとタイムなんて言ってない……！\nただ、一緒にボートに乗った話をしただけで。", "zh": "我、我才没说什么“轻飘飘甜蜜时光”……！\n只是说了我们一起乘船的事而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1006_052kao", "source_sha256": "52f9695a5aa97363867bba8eed58af0602dd44b99ebe52f7bf357fc4dd74233c", "ja": "まあ、素敵なふわふわ・すいーとタイムね！\nなんだかとっても楽しそう……。", "zh": "哇，好棒的轻飘飘甜蜜时光呀！\n感觉好像特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "605e115b9ce1139d619693cb598848cbc96affd5241f614bc841a60c829dbddd", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんだけ、ずるいのです！\n姫も、志保ちゃんとデートがしたいのです～！", "zh": "只有琴叶，太狡猾了！  \n本公主也想和志保约会～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "b8d29c8ec714d4b51dbd53e8c45960c512302c4363c8137be08105b4bde40a0b", "ja": "姫は、遊園地デートがいいと思うのです。\n観覧車でふたりきり……ロマンチックなのです♪", "zh": "公主觉得去游乐园约会就很不错呢。\n在摩天轮上两个人独处……好浪漫的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "cbe3387dae89b96468dc66b288b2211f05a027cf6dae38ad0775c30936f49f91", "ja": "はあ……。公演も控えているのに、遊園地だなんて。\nそんな時間があったら、私はもっと練習したいです。", "zh": "唉……都快要公演了，居然还要去游乐园。\n有那种时间的话，我更想多练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1010_033sih", "source_sha256": "0a252222f143c61a2d1d55a9b6d335f580d54b5efb47fc102b87437ec36c9179", "ja": "それに、ただ遊びに行ったわけじゃありません。\n琴葉さんの役作りを手伝っただけで……。", "zh": "而且，我们也不是单纯去玩的。\n只是帮琴叶小姐揣摩角色而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "15b996f43b6ad1c3bd2ea5c5ff1edb9b90b5ceafb97201e594a632ed515ad603", "ja": "志保ちゃん……\nまつりの役作りは、手伝ってくれないのです……？", "zh": "志保……\n也不愿意帮玛茨莉塑造角色吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "8efe039e400f0ecbc466a157f8b9d6241234143a55d70ffd105f82363084d477", "ja": "いえ、そういうわけじゃ……。", "zh": "不是，不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "2e6b42dfa19109a49b379c3aff2bbd0e80e0890c7de8cb34aab319d612c02d48", "ja": "今日の練習はもう終わりだし……志保ちゃんさえ\n良ければ、ふたりで行ってきたらどうかな？", "zh": "今天的练习已经结束了……如果志保愿意的话，你们两个一起去怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1014_052kao", "source_sha256": "8969cb2d2a8e6783740915c6da82bbf9c66733b75f50a87f192624795e4bece0", "ja": "そうね。遊園地のパレードやショウを見るのも、\nミュージカルをやる上で参考になると思うわ。", "zh": "是啊。去游乐园看看游行和表演，我觉得也能为演音乐剧提供参考。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cfdb5347d5e95e8517120dcc72d8cb903d80358ec030d06d0aaf7a57dd646d23", "ja": "いいんじゃないか？　志保。\n一緒に時間を過ごせば、お互い理解も深まると思うし。", "zh": "挺好的不是吗，志保？\n一起共度一段时间，彼此也能加深理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "ff15a69dec2f353745f5e8de49447ea994d31f4b2a5b3178fc41bd663b14e0fc", "ja": "琴葉さん、歌織さん……\n{$P$}さんまで。", "zh": "琴叶、歌织……就连{$P$}先生也是。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "4947af0b6e1f2524b3427485659b13054d7c91375254b0afd5e2766f7e70f7e5", "ja": "志保ちゃんが、最近ずっと考えていることの答え……\n姫なら、きっとヒントをあげられちゃうのですよ？", "zh": "志保最近一直在思考的事情的答案……\n如果是姬，一定能给你一点提示的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "f6dd94c53474aeed2552c5f1e33ec0cce3bd22cec2d9b60bbd76510169213cf3", "ja": "仕事を人質にするなんて、ずるいです。\n……はぁ、わかりました。少しだけですよ。", "zh": "居然拿工作当人质，太狡猾了。\n……唉，我知道了。就一会儿哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "bd613ce89d7e8c7306de4a408920cfc76d987e5100448a79e611bea13678881e", "ja": "さすが、志保ちゃんなのです！\nそれでは、さっそく行きましょー！", "zh": "不愧是志保呀！\n那我们马上出发吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "98610618008b57aa3505d0b5e42b86543ea35e5c9756d89fb58dadb1c03a15e6", "ja": "いってらっしゃい！\nふたりとも、気をつけるんだぞ～。", "zh": "路上小心！\n你们两个也要注意安全哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "7aff128a288b5e2ff4e3f3d748a03d41ba758ec763133f74ed1cfefa730b6eab", "ja": "はいほー！　到着なのです～！\nとってもキラキラな、おとぎの国なのです！", "zh": "嗨吼！到达啦～！\n这是一个闪闪发光的童话王国哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "8d26bfd925032b6505502678f69a8074899fc290a3075ad5f7dbc4f2a7a153ee", "ja": "さあ志保ちゃん、出発なのです！\nエスコートは、まつり王子にお任せなのです♪", "zh": "来吧，志保，我们出发吧！\n护送的事就交给王子玛茨莉吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "d1ca3a252574ad27ea1a22584950dd96c437c578441044e1904994ff6175f1df", "ja": "王子って言われても……。\nあの、いつもと同じに見えますけど。", "zh": "就算叫我王子……  \n那个，看起来也和平时一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1024_021mat", "source_sha256": "edee3481ad13a25ac14166466946995eb1abf0dc369f424dc78962822999c127", "ja": "志保ちゃんは、わんだほー！なメリーゴーラウンドと、\nドキドキのミラーハウス……どこから行きたいのです？", "zh": "志保想先去超棒的旋转木马，还是让人心跳加速的镜屋……想从哪里开始呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "744679b8a76f9a24db07ea85e24a61cf407ebfa1498b9c387a758751dc9151bd", "ja": "別に、どこでも。\nまつりさんの行きたいところで大丈夫です。", "zh": "随便，去哪里都行。\n去まつり想去的地方就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "6468944eb3ee1d75a8b672eb71a85f445eaca25081c0e909d88dbc2d7d830c16", "ja": "わかったのです！\nではジェットコースターへれっつごー！なのです♪", "zh": "明白了！\n那就向着过山车出发吧！♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "0a658e2a6f50b4ff54c84174e57e6532047609b339b57d8bd7954a4a31ba61fc", "ja": "ええ！？\nはあ……もう、どうしてこんなことに……。", "zh": "诶诶！？\n唉……真是的，怎么会变成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a7e23f9666de3fb9121026b32a2ae575681e906384a46ee836c066b09105d77", "ja": "あ。……でも、売店のグッズは、かわいい。\nあの猫のキーホルダー、あとで買って帰ろうかな……。", "zh": "啊……不过，售货亭里的周边很可爱。\n那个猫咪钥匙扣，要不要待会儿买了带回去呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1029_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "6d3d69b8b37d8353c262ff5bb1e6479a7bcb994a9d14b09c915ca82a4ed6e72d", "ja": "ふう……。ずいぶん、いろいろ乗っちゃった。\nそれに……遊園地で遊ぶなんて、久しぶりかも。", "zh": "呼……真是坐了不少东西。\n而且……来游乐园玩，好像也是久违的事了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "16760551a0c9a4adbb2c70ccb42c500abbbfa45df3c923d36c7198dcd65e7192", "ja": "それにしてもまつりさん、どこまで行ったのかしら。\n飲み物を買いに行ったにしては、やけに遅いけど……。", "zh": "话说回来，茉莉到底跑到哪里去了呢。说是去买饮料，也未免太慢了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1032_021mat", "source_sha256": "b4b7e633f8cb859aac1ef9c9d448ab474113f94347f2ec4a72fc433fe22e2460", "ja": "志～保ちゃん♪　お待たせなのです。", "zh": "志～保♪　让你久等了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "268ce0f598b15a4beb6fd8475745c99d688a927a8bfba901abc39aadbdb63675", "ja": "まつり王子がお姫様に、とってもふわふわな\nプレゼントを用意してきたのです。……くるりん♪", "zh": "茉莉王子给公主殿下，准备了一份超级毛茸茸的\n礼物哦。……转个圈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "b87d82287ff9a258aa5e0a2fa43b96fdc667ddcf1911e22ad7206c5b49106bb8", "ja": "あ、これ……！　あの猫のキーホルダー！？", "zh": "啊，这个……！是那只猫的钥匙扣！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "69dd01ea9a3c9c67b8b5605b6a0f789f8e7777252037bf46a888da3503c19e21", "ja": "ど、どうして、わかったんですか。\n私が、これを買うつもりだったって……。", "zh": "你、你是怎么知道的？\n知道我原本打算买这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "993b5747ba312a2652cafd2ef79dcb9cb7c6b4b66ec2bc9b89e023c2fddf3110", "ja": "簡単なのです。志保ちゃんがこの子を見たときの目、\nとってもキラキラしていたのです。", "zh": "很简单的哦。志保看到这个孩子时的眼神，\n闪闪发亮的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1037_021mat", "source_sha256": "b12491eb13e99ec42b71e0851c7885db84dfe952bb8f934ec8d7f72d60e3df25", "ja": "大好きなお姫様には、ずっとキラキラしていてほしい。\n王子様とは、そう願うものなのですよ。……ね？", "zh": "希望最喜欢的公主能够一直闪闪发光。\n所谓王子，就是会这样祈愿的存在哦。……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "1d5d6f1b8bb759ac63b1f4c3ad178f27241224b0da7cdb5ccd162afefe7cbd46", "ja": "（こ、これは……。\nたしかに、ちょっと王子っぽい……かも……）", "zh": "（这、这是……\n确实有点像王子……也许……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1039_021mat", "source_sha256": "9d7bd6ca3d3f24df121f90599cd7f2dc4055f0e8f3589e3914cb2eaa0dceb822", "ja": "さ、今日のフィナーレは、観覧車なのです♪\nとびきり・びゅーてぃほー！な景色を見ましょー！", "zh": "那么，今天的压轴就是摩天轮哦♪  \n一起去看看超级——美丽的景色吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1040_021mat", "source_sha256": "957d2fe75a94a64b1499e8c8c8f6bb11d840b31f5c9773f4f64ed659b72dde07", "ja": "志保ちゃん。今日は、楽しんでくれたのです？", "zh": "志保，今天玩得开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1041_033sih", "source_sha256": "4660b958e060f6e4b26406e61d83a95c3842b5b539b91df815795a6d34f6a066", "ja": "ええ……そうですね。\n自分でも、ちょっと意外なくらい……楽しかったです。", "zh": "嗯……是啊。\n连我自己都觉得有点意外……真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "50d623f3d150506780dccb94fb9ece26af84643d95e9bb0c081e0dc2a9757ba0", "ja": "わんだほー！　志保ちゃんのキュートな笑顔が\n見られて、まつり王子もハッピー！なのですよ。", "zh": "太棒了～！能看到志保可爱的笑容，\n茉莉王子也超开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1043_033sih", "source_sha256": "a97e805fb02ff3992e3240d8ded9dc2c00f217e3564bd6c337395a2ac6aba082", "ja": "まつりさんって……そういうの、\nどこまで計算してやってるんですか？", "zh": "小百合……这种事，你到底是算计到什么程度才做的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1044_021mat", "source_sha256": "e444724d5bdfc434dde3f3c240f7dbe742a560b4de1f8341f0ded75b5d84d433", "ja": "ほ？　なんのことなのです？", "zh": "嗯？你在说什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1045_033sih", "source_sha256": "0617b8e8388202ca12ffb1f2c7dd523153b88d87358f06159412860a32a0823a", "ja": "いえ。……それより、そろそろ教えてくれませんか。\n歌織さんに出された課題の、ヒントというのを。", "zh": "没。……比起这个，差不多也该告诉我了吧。\n歌织小姐出的那道课题，所谓的提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1046_021mat", "source_sha256": "96a04b0b898f58a87f6be203a37f46ba5daa1372a91d2bb515594a3cc231b2ec", "ja": "キラキラなミュージカルの住人さん達が、\nどうして歌いだしてしまうのか……。", "zh": "闪闪发光的音乐剧居民们，为什么会唱起歌来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1047_021mat", "source_sha256": "c80b4ff73bd7521607112dac5b67a43a5b6fc14feb69f314ed9f473faf55a9cb", "ja": "それを知りたいのなら、まつり達の劇場に、\nとってもピッタリなお手本がいると思うのです。", "zh": "如果想知道的话，我觉得茉莉她们的剧场里，就有一个非常合适的榜样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1048_021mat", "source_sha256": "a2ecd8a2a735b1510e3310963252fdadc2857c202f92e102a6af1b02522d7f44", "ja": "まつりに言えるのは、ここまでなのです。\nあとは志保ちゃんなら、わかるはずなのです。", "zh": "玛茨莉能告诉你的，就只有这些了。\n接下来，志保应该就能明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_04_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "29d47bc2cce0ebf89fba4bf94daf0d686d1f61ea7bc66375e3563f9a0b6cc77b", "ja": "お手本？　いったい、誰のこと……あ！\nもしかして……。", "zh": "榜样？到底是在说谁……啊！\n难道是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
